(
    title: "Guardian",
    description: Some("You steer the starship Guardian along the foot of the screen while the enemy Dromeda drifts across the top, raining thermo-molecular bombs down on the three worlds you protect. Your laser can\'t reach Dromeda itself, so you pick off each bomb before it lands — miss, and it tears through a planet\'s force field; let the gap widen and the next one through destroys a world. Hold on until the last planet falls."),
